魏州府舍爲興聖宮。宋白曰：唐莊宗卽位於魏州，宰相豆盧革因進擬爲興聖宮，以皇子繼岌爲興聖宮使。","note_content_jianti_auto":"按后唐洛阳有西宫兴圣宫。此时未得洛阳，当以魏州府舍为兴圣宫。宋白曰：唐庄宗即位于魏州，宰相豆卢革因进拟为兴圣宫，以皇子继岌为兴圣宫使。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":125,"tongjian_id":"cb09cb70-db0e-11ef-a555-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"天雄","place_name_jianti_auto":"天雄","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"cb09cb7f-db0e-11ef-83a8-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"成德","place_name_jianti_auto":"成德","place_note":"总部设真定府【河北省正定县】","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"cb09cb80-db0e-11ef-84b0-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"義武","place_name_jianti_auto":"义武","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"cb09cb81-db0e-11ef-9872-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"橫海","place_name_jianti_auto":"横海","place_note":"总部设沧州【河北沧州市东南】","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"cb09cb82-db0e-11ef-b7fe-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"盧龍","place_name_jianti_auto":"卢龙","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"cb09cb83-db0e-11ef-b05d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"大同","place_name_jianti_auto":"大同","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"cb09cb84-db0e-11ef-b18f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"振武","place_name_jianti_auto":"振武","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"cb09cb85-db0e-11ef-a120-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"鴈門","place_name_jianti_auto":"鴈门","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"cb09cb86-db0e-11ef-83f0-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"河東","place_name_jianti_auto":"河东","place_note":"总部太原府","start_index":29,"tongjian_id":"cb09cb87-db0e-11ef-8667-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"護國","place_name_jianti_auto":"护国","start_index":32,"tongjian_id":"cb09cb88-db0e-11ef-8f36-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"晉絳","place_name_jianti_auto":"晋绛","start_index":35,"tongjian_id":"cb09cb89-db0e-11ef-8a4f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"安國","place_name_jianti_auto":"安国","start_index":38,"tongjian_id":"cb09cb8a-db0e-11ef-a0cc-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"昭義","place_name_jianti_auto":"昭义","start_index":41,"tongjian_id":"cb09cb8b-db0e